{"id": "UgxU3cmPM2srm7SBoYB4AaABAg.AbmzKSIRaDMAbvJMlZIOJJ", "parent": "UgxU3cmPM2srm7SBoYB4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "미국보단 중진국의 함정?에 빠진듯", "published": "2026-10-13T21:45:14", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
